(Collocated Servers) 72 710.67 T
2 12 Q
0.58 (Most of the performance penalties associated with Microkernel \050MK\051) 93.6 684 P
0.25 (systems result from locating an OS server in user space and using a gener-) 72 670 P
0.47 (al-purpose IPC message mechanism to implement RPC, thus adding over-) 72 656 P
5.26 (head to the system call path. Therefore the principal strategy for) 72 642 P
1.93 (improving MK performance has been to move the OS server task back) 72 628 P
0.74 (into the kernel address space and to optimize the RPC mechanism for the) 72 614 P
(case where the client and server share an address space.) 72 600 T
0.88 (Collocation means locating separately-compiled and linked programs) 93.6 574 P
1.56 (in the same address space. In the current implementation of collocation,) 72 560 P
2.45 (each program runs in a separate task. This corresponds to the original) 72 546 P
1.81 (model of collocating several tasks in the same address space. However) 72 532 P
1.81 (,) 429 532 P
1.45 (the model is evolving in the direction of having several separately com-) 72 518 P
(piled and linked programs loaded into a) 72 504 T
(single task.) 265.54 504 T
0.7 (When programs share the same address space, it becomes possible to) 93.6 478 P
0.78 (replace IPC message-based RPC with a form of direct procedure call that) 72 464 P
0.38 (is called) 72 450 P
5 F
0.38 (short-cir) 115.4 450 P
0.38 (cuited RPC) 156.94 450 P
2 F
0.38 (. This is many times more ef) 212.29 450 P
0.38 (\336cient than mes-) 351.29 450 P
2.2 (sage passing, and accounts for the lar) 72 436 P
2.2 (gest single performance improve-) 263.85 436 P
3.96 (ment. One of the requirements for this project was to maintain the) 72 422 P
0.09 (modularity of the MK design. In the case of RPC, this means that collocat-) 72 408 P
0.42 (ed programs must not be aware that they are communicating via short-cir-) 72 394 P
(cuited rather than message-based RPC.) 72 380 T
1.72 (More information can be found in the paper [5] included in the re-) 93.6 354 P
(lease package.) 72 340 T
0 14 Q
